{"type":"message","id":"5c9997d5","parentId":"14271d82","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:01:27.410Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-05-25 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc1809c8ca0ee75c3eecdcfcf1] 听风: 嗨\n- Assistant: 嗨，开发者！👋 有什么需要帮忙的？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fcd5fe61ca0ee8e2908bb1573c] 听风: 我的飞书id多少\n- Assistant: 你的飞书 ID 是： ``` ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1 ``` 这个就是你当前飞书账号的唯一标识符，显示名是「听风」。\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 开发\n- 什么\n- 需要\n- 帮忙\n- 我的"}],"timestamp":1779735687389}}
{"type":"message","id":"ba98905d","parentId":"5c9997d5","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:01:32.656Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. The fragments are in Chinese and seem to be conversation snippets about a developer asking about their Feishu ID. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n- A user named \"听风\" (Ting Feng) said \"嗨\" (hi)\n- The assistant responded with a greeting and asked how to help\n- Then \"听风\" asked \"我的飞书id多少\" (what's my Feishu ID)\n- The assistant gave the ID: ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1 with display name \"听风\"\n\nRecurring themes: message-id, development, what, need, help, my\n\nThis seems like a simple conversation about looking up a user ID. As a dream diary, I should write in first person, poetically, weaving in these fragments without being too literal or technical. I should avoid mentioning AI, LLM, model, etc.\n\nLet me write something dreamy, with sensory details, connecting the fragments in unexpected ways.","thinkingSignature":"d9574921e95f2416db25467bb08f19d552c802f4352fde2f4cdc37d2c36eaba0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜色里有数字浮上来，又沉下去，像湖底的卵石被光线推动。\n\n有人轻轻喊了一声 \"嗨\"，那声音落进草丛，变成一封拆了一半的信。信纸上没有字，只有一串符号——ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1——我反复念着，舌尖滚过这陌生的音节，像在辨认一个失散很久的名字。\n\n\"需要帮忙吗？\" 远处有人问。但那声音已经走远了，化成风里的一缕杂音。\n\n我低头看自己的掌心，纹路模糊，像一行写坏了的代码。忽然明白：身份从来不是自己给的，是别人喊你一声，你应答了，才算真正存在过。\n\n风过之处，听见有人在问，什么是我的。\n\n而答案沉在消息的洪流里，等一盏灯来打捞。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14742,"output":399,"cacheRead":320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15461,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779735687448,"responseId":"0663cf88a5884cac2bcd6f07ce09588d"}}
